From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Herrie <Github.com@herrie.org>
Date: Sat, 8 Aug 2026 17:57:28 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] sysbus: drop client permissions for ACGs that do not exist

com.webos.appinstalld.perm.json asks for three access control groups
that nothing declares:

WARNING: luneos-dev-image-1.0-r0 do_validate_ls2_acg: Found 17 group(s) used in client-permissions.d but not defined
'applicationinstall.interface' being used in:
  com.webos.appinstalld.perm.json
'diagnostics.telemetry' being used in:
  com.webos.appinstalld.perm.json
'session.management' being used in:
  com.webos.appinstalld.perm.json

appinstalld.groups.json declares applicationinstall.management and
applicationinstall.devmode, not applicationinstall.interface, and there
is no telemetry or session manager service in the tree, so all three
entries are dead weight.
Signed-off-by: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
---
Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 files/sysbus/com.webos.appinstalld.perm.json | 3 ---
 1 file changed, 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/files/sysbus/com.webos.appinstalld.perm.json b/files/sysbus/com.webos.appinstalld.perm.json
index 9d87282..2355b3f 100644
--- a/files/sysbus/com.webos.appinstalld.perm.json
+++ b/files/sysbus/com.webos.appinstalld.perm.json
@@ -1,12 +1,9 @@
 {
     "com.webos.appInstallService": [
-        "applicationinstall.interface",
         "application.launcher",
         "appmanager.management",
-        "session.management",
         "application.operation",
         "database.operation",
-        "diagnostics.telemetry",
         "servicebus.configuration",
         "servicebus.management"
     ]
